      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When I checked the Log, I got a \"Bad Gateway\" error during the upload.\nThis is a server-side issue, isn't it?\n--------------\nApiFile file_fce449a3-e12f-4a87-bb91-38462af7e2d9: Error: Failed to upload file.\nFailed to start part upload: Bad Gateway\nUnityEngine.StackTraceUtility:ExtractStackTrace ()\nUnityEngine.DebugLogHandler:LogFormat (UnityEngine.LogType,UnityEngine.Object,string,object[])",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
