      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Uploads are direct to Amazon storage servers, so any kind of poor routing or internet issues will cause upload to be quite slow. Uploads never traverse a \"VRChat-owned\" network or process.\nIn short, uploads go as quick as they can, and we don't have any control how your upload is routed across the internet! We've made no changes to the 2019 SDK regarding uploading content (aside from marking it as \"2019\" content instead of \"2018\" content).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
