      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: already in unity 2018, uploads via the SDK are significantly slower (over 20x slower in my testing) than a single threaded upload to us-east-1 S3 using chrome. I'm not sure what your http client is doing to make it so slow, but I wouldn't dismiss this without benchmarking to see if it has gotten even worse in 2019.",
