      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Hi! Thank you always!\nIt seems that the time between the start of upload and the error occurs is about 30 minutes each time.\nIs it possible that server security is blocking uploads for more than 30 minutes?\nUnity 2018 uploads are still fast and complete without any problems.\nThis only takes about five minutes!\nI tried uploading Unity 2019 on two types of Internet lines.\nBoth are high-speed lines with speeds above 20M, but both are errors.",
      "viewerReactions": null
