      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I did some further investigation. I was unable to reproduce a significant difference between upload speeds on unity 2018 and 2019. However, I was able to confirm that the SDK upload speed is _significantly_ lower than what network conditions allowed for. See https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/sdk-uploads-are-slow-due-to-not-filling-the-tcp-window",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
